{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"luxun-e-o040a","title":"孙权北征遣陆议诸葛瑾攻襄阳韩扁奉表归遇敌被获","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-o040a-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"孙权北征遣陆议诸葛瑾攻襄阳韩扁奉表归遇敌被获","evidence":["luxun-e-o040a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣攻","evidence":["luxun-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"出征遣使","evidence":["luxun-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"出征","evidence":["luxun-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0029","role":"奉表被获","evidence":["luxun-e-o040a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"嘉禾三年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"luxun-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"luxun-q-o040","basis":"嘉禾三年"},"evidence":["luxun-e-o040a-q","luxun-q-o040","wuzhu-q-o107","zhuge-q-o039","zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o040a-q","source_order":[58,198,"O040a"],"order":10342}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0029","name":"韩扁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0002","name":"诸葛瑾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0115","name":"陆逊","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o040a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-1d4f644e2f180ba3f0bd","layer":"original","quote":"嘉禾（五）〔三〕年，权北征，使逊与诸葛瑾攻襄阳。逊遣亲人韩扁赍表〖1〗；奉报还，遇敌于沔中〖2〗，抄逻得扁〖3〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57},{"id":"luxun-q-o040","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-1d4f644e2f180ba3f0bd","layer":"original","quote":"嘉禾（五）〔三〕年，权北征，使逊与诸葛瑾攻襄阳。逊遣亲人韩扁赍表〖1〗；奉报还，遇敌于沔中〖2〗，抄逻得扁〖3〗。瑾闻之甚惧，书与逊云：“大驾已旋〖4〗，贼得韩扁，具知吾阔狭〖5〗。且水干，宜当急去！”逊未答，方催人种葑、豆〖6〗，与诸将弈棋、射戏如常。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":127},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o107","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-adeefad7184b459985c1","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“兵久不辍，民困于役，岁或不登〖2〗。其宽诸逋〖3〗，勿复督课〖4〗。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-934abed655148ea08df3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗十二年：建兴十二年（公元 234）。以上诸葛亮出兵北伐共计五次，经由祁山只有两次。后世所说的“六出祁山”并非历史真实。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1e22705f935572994567","start":0,"end":62},{"id":"zhuge-q-o039","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e60db7c722cd4fe4fb69","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春〖2〗，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运；据武功五丈原〖3〗，与司马宣王对于渭南〖4〗。亮每患粮不继，使己志不申；是以分兵屯田，为久驻之基。耕者杂于渭滨居民之间，而百姓安堵〖5〗，军无私焉〖6〗。﹝三﹞相持百余日。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
